{"unit_id":"addozhang__dsh-turn-toc#card-zh","repo":"addozhang/dsh-turn-toc","commit":"dd497e2f96ad076cc8c6adc86f17935905a3a7d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Turn TOC 是面向 DSH Web 的对话章节导航插件，通过在聊天正文右侧注册控件，按当前轮次的 Markdown 标题生成层级目录。它会随滚动高亮正在阅读的标题，并以刻度轨道呈现目录；悬停或固定后可展开面板、折叠子标题、跳转到章节，也能回到当前轮开头或切换前后轮次。适合在长对话中快速定位回复内容的用户。插件不需要额外密钥或外部服务；窄屏或右侧空间不足时不会显示目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:13-30","src/client/outline.ts:137-172","src/client/TurnTocTrigger.tsx:132-153","src/client/heading-dom.ts:173-241"]}
{"unit_id":"addozhang__dsh-turn-toc#card-en","repo":"addozhang/dsh-turn-toc","commit":"dd497e2f96ad076cc8c6adc86f17935905a3a7d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Turn TOC adds a heading outline beside DSH Web chats. It extracts Markdown headings from the current turn and highlights the section in view. Hover or pin the rail to open a panel, fold subsections, jump to headings, or move between turns. Narrow layouts hide the outline.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:13-30","src/client/outline.ts:137-172","src/client/TurnTocTrigger.tsx:132-153","src/client/heading-dom.ts:173-241"]}
