{"unit_id":"addozhang__dsh-turn-toc#feature-1","repo":"addozhang/dsh-turn-toc","commit":"dd497e2f96ad076cc8c6adc86f17935905a3a7d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Turn TOC 的功能「按标题生成目录」：从当前回复的 Markdown 文本提取 ATX 标题并按层级列出，代码围栏中的标题不会纳入目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/outline.ts:92-107","src/client/outline.ts:116-129"]}
